WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.190
The conversations reaching your frontline have changed.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.736
AI now handles the simple ones.

00:00:07.936 --> 00:00:12.153
What's left is complex, emotional, and matters more than ever.

00:00:13.003 --> 00:00:14.417
Hi, I'm Sia.

00:00:14.517 --> 00:00:17.397
Welcome to Certified Contact Centre Excellence.

00:00:18.047 --> 00:00:27.306
Six modules. Service quality. Clear communication. Listening. Empathy. Call control. And handling difficult customers.

00:00:27.656 --> 00:00:31.934
I guide you through every module, and you can ask me anything, out loud.

00:00:32.284 --> 00:00:36.708
Listen to sample customer and agent calls, and hear what great sounds like.

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:42.708
Practise realistic customer conversations, then review your performance and talk through best practice with me.

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:48.556
And hear from industry experts on empathy, call control, and managing difficult customers.

00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:55.197
Pass three practice calls to earn your Certified Contact Centre Professional (CCCP) qualification.

00:00:55.847 --> 00:01:01.620
CCCE has been co-designed with industry to meet the needs of the AI-enabled contact centre.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:06.176
CCCE isn't simply an upgrade to traditional contact centre training.

00:01:06.376 --> 00:01:15.031
It is a program for building higher-order human skills and equipping agents for the role they'll actually need to play as automation handles more of the routine work.

00:01:15.581 --> 00:01:21.008
The future of customer conversations starts here. Let's raise the bar, together.

00:01:21.658 --> 00:01:33.319
Reach out to CSIA at info@csia.com.au to get further details on the CCCE program, or to discuss how Sia can enable your organisation's training programs.
